    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A tiny hummingbird worked entirely in small pieces. The compact size makes this a great first bird amigurumi. Start every piece with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "hummingbird-magic-ring"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and work in continuous rounds with a stitch marker. Use a smaller hook if needed to keep the fabric tight enough to hold stuffing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Iridescent green DK yarn, approx. 6 g. Ruby red DK yarn, approx. 2 g. Cream DK yarn, approx. 2 g. 3.5 mm crochet hook. Tapestry needle. Craft scissors. Soft measuring tape. Pair of 6 mm "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "hummingbird-safety-eyes"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "safety eyes"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Polyester stuffing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Gauge"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "24 dc x 28 rows = 10 x 10 cm in DK yarn on a 3.5 mm hook."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pieces"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
